---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="2026 翻墙软件下载大全 - 官方纯净版客户端 (Windows/Mac/iOS/Android)"
	description="拒绝流氓软件和木马！老叶为您整理了 2026 最新最全的科学上网代理客户端。提供 Clash、Shadowrocket、v2rayN 等全平台正版、开源官方下载地址。"
>
	<main class="flex-1 bg-slate-50 pb-24">
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-16">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl tracking-tight">
					全平台<span class="text-emerald-600">正版翻墙软件</span>下载中心
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
					🚨 警告：百度搜索排名前列的下载站 99% 带有木马！老叶在此仅提供官方开源 (GitHub) 或官方应用商店的绝对纯净、安全下载链接。
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Section -->
		<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
			
			<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
				
				<!-- Windows / Mac 区 -->
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
						<div class="p-2 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-600 rounded-lg">
							<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">电脑端 (Windows / Mac)</h2>
					</div>
					
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<a href="/downloads/clash-for-windows" class="block bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
								<div>
									<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 flex items-center gap-2">
										Clash for Windows 
										<span class="text-xs font-normal px-2 py-0.5 bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 rounded-full">已停更</span>
									</h3>
									<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">曾经的王者，但内核已旧。老叶带你平滑过渡到新版。</p>
								</div>
								<div class="text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-500">
									<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
								</div>
							</div>
						</a>

						<a href="/downloads/v2rayn" class="block bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
								<div>
									<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 flex items-center gap-2">
										v2rayN <span class="text-xs font-normal px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-full">稳定首选</span>
									</h3>
									<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Windows 上最老牌、最极简的 V2Ray/Xray 客户端。</p>
								</div>
								<div class="text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-500">
									<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
								</div>
							</div>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- 手机端 (iOS / Android) 区 -->
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
						<div class="p-2 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg">
							<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">手机端 (iOS / Android)</h2>
					</div>
					
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<a href="/downloads/shadowrocket" class="block bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
								<div>
									<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 flex items-center gap-2">
										Shadowrocket (小火箭)
										<span class="text-xs font-normal px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full">iOS 必备</span>
									</h3>
									<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">苹果端装机量第一的翻墙神器，内附免费外区账号获取方法。</p>
								</div>
								<div class="text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-500">
									<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
								</div>
							</div>
						</a>

						<a href="/downloads/v2rayng" class="block bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
								<div>
									<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-emerald-600 flex items-center gap-2">
										v2rayNG
										<span class="text-xs font-normal px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-full">安卓最稳</span>
									</h3>
									<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">安卓阵营完全免费、极简开源的代理软件，永不掉线。</p>
								</div>
								<div class="text-slate-400 group-hover:text-emerald-500">
									<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
								</div>
							</div>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
